                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5231/968: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Spain</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Bowers</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-05-06T19:00:00-04:00">May 6, 1935—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>24. Your No. 27, May 6, 1 p.m., last paragraph. First meeting with Spanish
                    negotiators took place May 3. Negotiations still in preliminary stage but we are
                    meeting daily in order to expedite matters as much as possible. We shall keep
                    you advised of any developments of moment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
